    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Exercise\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- Write function\n",
        "- `def single_tax(pay):`\n",
        "- *Return* tax cost.\n",
        "    - Return not print!\n",
        "- Bonus: Also write `single_tax_rate` which returns the percent tax rate at some income level.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "| Rate   | From    |\n",
        "|--------|--------:|\n",
        "| 10%    | 0       |\n",
        "| 15%    | 9275    |\n",
        "| 25%    | 37650   |\n",
        "| 28%    | 91150   |\n",
        "| 33%    | 190150  |\n",
        "| 35%    | 413350  |\n",
        "| 39.6%  | 415050  |\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Solution\n",
        "\n",
        ":::: {.columns}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- Spoiler alert!\n"
      ],
      "id": "cfa8ebcf"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "def single_tax(pay):\n",
        "    tax = 0\n",
        "    if pay > 415050:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 415050) * .396\n",
        "        pay = 415050\n",
        "    if pay > 413350:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 413350) * .35\n",
        "        pay = 413350\n",
        "    if pay > 190150:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 190150) * .33\n",
        "        pay = 190150\n",
        "    if pay > 91150:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 91150) * .28\n",
        "        pay = 91150\n",
        "    if pay > 37650:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 37650) * .25\n",
        "        pay = 37650\n",
        "    if pay > 9275:\n",
        "        tax += (pay - 9275) * .15\n",
        "        pay = 9275\n",
        "    return tax + pay * .1"
      ],
      "id": "ab8fa077",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "- The solution gives the following results!\n"
      ],
      "id": "5e18e8f9"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "[\n",
        "    single_tax(100000),\n",
        "    single_tax(100000),\n",
        "    single_tax(200000),\n",
        "    single_tax(300000),\n",
        "    single_tax(400000),\n",
        "]"
      ],
      "id": "f5ed90e4",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "- `115529.25` matches our calculations.\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "::::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Challenge Problem\n",
        "\n",
        "- Calculate at what income does the tax rate reach the second highest marginal tax rate of 35%?\n",
        "    - That is, at what `pay` does `tax == pay * .35`"
      ],
      "id": "3ea245b0"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "m = .396\n",
        "b = 0\n",
        "b += (415050 - 413350) * .35\n",
        "b += (413350 - 190150) * .33\n",
        "b += (190150 - 91150) * .28\n",
        "b += (91150 - 37650) * .25\n",
        "b += (37650 - 9275) * .15\n",
        "b += 9275 * .1\n",
        "(m * -415050 + b)/(.35 - m)"
      ],
      "id": "fa09174a",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "## Bonus Solution\n",
        "\n",
        "- `single_tax` with loops"
      ],
      "id": "35438c7f"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| code-fold: true\n",
        "def single_tax(pay):\n",
        "    tax_policy = [\n",
        "        [415050, .396], \n",
        "        [413350, .35],\n",
        "        [190150, .33],\n",
        "        [91150, .28],\n",
        "        [37650, .25],\n",
        "        [9275, .15]\n",
        "    ]\n",
        "    tax = 0\n",
        "    for bracket in tax_policy:\n",
        "        if pay > bracket[0]:\n",
        "            tax += (pay - bracket[0]) * bracket[1]\n",
        "            pay = bracket[0]\n",
        "    return tax + pay * .1"
      ],
      "id": "74280529",
      "execution_count": null,
      "outputs": []
    }
